Source: pgedge-ai-dba-workbench
Section: database
Priority: optional
Maintainer: pgEdge Build Team <support@pgedge.com>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13)
Standards-Version: 4.1.3
Homepage: https://github.com/pgEdge/ai-dba-workbench

Package: pgedge-ai-dba-upgrade-check
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: pgEdge AI DBA Workbench upgrade configuration check
 Checks the installed pgEdge AI DBA Server configuration with this
 release's server before any other package of the suite is upgraded,
 and stops the upgrade if this release would refuse to start with it.

Package: pgedge-ai-dba-server
Architecture: any
Pre-Depends: pgedge-ai-dba-upgrade-check (>= ${binary:Version})
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, openssl
Description: pgEdge AI DBA Server
 Core AI DBA server providing REST API and AI-powered analysis for
 PostgreSQL databases.

Package: pgedge-ai-dba-collector
Architecture: any
Pre-Depends: pgedge-ai-dba-upgrade-check (>= ${binary:Version})
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, pgedge-ai-dba-server (= ${binary:Version}), openssl
Description: pgEdge AI DBA Collector
 Metrics and data collector agent for the pgEdge AI DBA Workbench.
 Collects PostgreSQL performance data and sends it to the AI DBA server.

Package: pgedge-ai-dba-alerter
Architecture: any
Pre-Depends: pgedge-ai-dba-upgrade-check (>= ${binary:Version})
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, pgedge-ai-dba-server (= ${binary:Version})
Description: pgEdge AI DBA Alerter
 Alerting agent for the pgEdge AI DBA Workbench. Monitors PostgreSQL
 health and triggers AI-powered alerts based on configurable rules.

Package: pgedge-ai-dba-client
Architecture: all
Pre-Depends: pgedge-ai-dba-upgrade-check (>= ${source:Version})
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, pgedge-ai-dba-server (= ${source:Version}), nginx
Description: pgEdge AI DBA Web Client
 React-based web interface for the pgEdge AI DBA Workbench. Provides
 dashboards, alerting UI, and AI-powered database analysis views.

